{
 "file": "03YSK69B base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:1a4",
   "ptr": "0x1a4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「よ～しよし、ハワードにジョーンズ、\\n",
   "en": "\"Theeere, good boys. Howard, Jones, you're coming along too.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:1cd",
   "ptr": "0x1cd",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  お前たちも連れてってやるからな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:1a4"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:23c",
   "ptr": "0x23c",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "「わんわんわん！」\\f",
   "en": "\"Woof woof woof!\"",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:29b",
   "ptr": "0x29b",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "「う～わん！　わん！」\\f",
   "en": "\"Grrr-woof! Woof!\"",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:2e4",
   "ptr": "0x2e4",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「私は貴族出身の学者です。\\f",
   "en": "\"I am a scholar of noble birth.",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:304",
   "ptr": "0x304",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　我々が入手した古文書の中には、今日\\n",
   "en": "Among the old texts we acquired was information that could have predicted today's events...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:32d",
   "ptr": "0x32d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  の事態を予測できるような情報もあり\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:304"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:356",
   "ptr": "0x356",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ましたが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:304"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:36c",
   "ptr": "0x36c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  それらは検閲を加えて削除し、まとめ\\n",
   "en": "We censored it, struck it out, and burned it all.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:395",
   "ptr": "0x395",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  て燃やしてしまいました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:36c"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:3b5",
   "ptr": "0x3b5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　市民が知るべき情報ではありませんか\\n",
   "en": "It was not information the citizens needed to know, you see.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:3de",
   "ptr": "0x3de",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  らね。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:3b5"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:3ec",
   "ptr": "0x3ec",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もし、自分たちの住む土地に《黒竜》\\n",
   "en": "If people knew that something called the Black Dragon truly existed in the land they live on, no one would want to live there, would they?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:415",
   "ptr": "0x415",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  などというものが実在すると知ってた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:3ec"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:43e",
   "ptr": "0x43e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ら、誰も、そんな地に住もうとは思わ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:3ec"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:467",
   "ptr": "0x467",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ないでしょう？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:3ec"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:47d",
   "ptr": "0x47d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　でも、《黒竜》さえ、眠ったままだっ\\n",
   "en": "But if only the Black Dragon had stayed asleep, none of this would have happened! What on earth went wrong...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:4a6",
   "ptr": "0x4a6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  たら、こんなことにはならなかったん\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:47d"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:4cf",
   "ptr": "0x4cf",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  です！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:47d"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:4dc",
   "ptr": "0x4dc",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　いったい何が悪かったのか・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  です！",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:47d"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:502",
   "ptr": "0x502",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　確かに、先鞭をつけたのは領主様の遺\\n",
   "en": "True, the lord's order to survey the ruins started it all, but it wasn't only that... It's as if we were toyed with by some unseen fate...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:52b",
   "ptr": "0x52b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  跡調査命令でしたが、それだけではな\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:502"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:554",
   "ptr": "0x554",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  く・・・何か目に見えない運命に翻弄\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:502"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:57d",
   "ptr": "0x57d",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  されていたような・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:502"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:59b",
   "ptr": "0x59b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　気がつかないうちに、遠いとこまで運\\n",
   "en": "As if we'd been carried far away before we even noticed... That's how I feel now.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:5c4",
   "ptr": "0x5c4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  び去られてしまったような・・・今は\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:59b"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:5ed",
   "ptr": "0x5ed",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  そんな気分です」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:59b"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:607",
   "ptr": "0x607",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「残った学者の仲間には申し訳ないが、\\n",
   "en": "\"I'm sorry for my fellow scholars who stay behind, but I'm getting out. I don't even want to think about the Black Dragon anymore.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:630",
   "ptr": "0x630",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  私は逃げさせてもらいますよ。もう、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:659",
   "ptr": "0x659",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《黒竜》のことなんか、考えたくもな\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:682",
   "ptr": "0x682",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  いんでね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:607"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:6db",
   "ptr": "0x6db",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「以前、オールバインの道具屋から、\\n",
   "en": "\"A while back, I got hold of an interesting old text from the item shop in Allvaine... Now where did I put it...?\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:702",
   "ptr": "0x702",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  面白そうな古文書を手に入れたんだ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:6db"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:729",
   "ptr": "0x729",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  が・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:6db"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:738",
   "ptr": "0x738",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  あれは、どこに仕舞ったかな・・・？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  が・・・",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:6db"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:791",
   "ptr": "0x791",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「《黒竜》の波動は地を這うように進み、\\n",
   "en": "\"The Black Dragon's Wave creeps along the ground and strikes only low-lying places... That was in the part we censored out of the library's old texts.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:7bc",
   "ptr": "0x7bc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  低い場所のみを襲う・・・これは図書\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:791"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:7e5",
   "ptr": "0x7e5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  館の古文書から検閲削除した部分に書\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:791"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:80e",
   "ptr": "0x80e",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  かれていたことです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:791"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:82a",
   "ptr": "0x82a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あと、我々、貴族の歴史に汚点を残す\\n",
   "en": "We also censored any wording that would stain the history of us nobles. For example, the XXX in the 'Mountaintop City Plan' is 'invaders.'",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:853",
   "ptr": "0x853",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  ような表現にも検閲が加えられました。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:82a"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:87e",
   "ptr": "0x87e",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  たとえば『山上都市計画』の×××は、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:82a"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:8a9",
   "ptr": "0x8a9",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  侵略者です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:82a"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:8bd",
   "ptr": "0x8bd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族の歴史は、一点の曇りもない、栄\\n",
   "en": "The nobles' history had to be spotless, adorned with nothing but glory...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:8e6",
   "ptr": "0x8e6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  光に彩られたものでなければならなか\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:8bd"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:90f",
   "ptr": "0x90f",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  った・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:8bd"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:921",
   "ptr": "0x921",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そのような権威があってこそ、国が平\\n",
   "en": "Only with such authority could the country be kept at peace. ...Not that it matters anymore.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:94a",
   "ptr": "0x94a",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  和に保たれていたのです。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:921"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:969",
   "ptr": "0x969",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ・・・もはや、どうでもいいことです\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  和に保たれていたのです。",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:921"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:992",
   "ptr": "0x992",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  が」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 03YSK69B:921"
  },
  {
   "id": "03YSK69B:9a0",
   "ptr": "0x9a0",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「我々が逃げた後ですか？\\n",
   "en": "\"After we've fled? Who knows...? What will happen, I wonder?\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": "not on a walked path: file scan found this message op"
  },
